# Intelligence API - REST Client test file
# Use with the VS Code REST Client extension (humao.rest-client).
# Click "Send Request" above any ### block to execute it.
# Requires the API running locally: make run or docker compose up

@host = http://localhost:8080
@adminKey = test-admin-key
@domainKey = test-domain-key

### Health check (no auth required)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/hello

### App info (admin only)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

### Domain lookup (admin key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup (domain key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{domainKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com", "example.org"]
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot (admin/premium key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true
}

### Domain lookup with screenshot - should return 403 (basic tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{domainKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "screenshot": true
}

### Typosquatting - shallow (admin/premium key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Typosquatting - deep with active checks (admin/premium key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"],
  "depth": "deep",
  "active": true
}

### Typosquatting - should return 403 (basic tier)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain/typosquatting
Content-Type: application/json
X-API-Key: {{domainKey}}

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Domain lookup - should return 401 (no key)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/domain
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "domains": ["example.com"]
}

### Info - should return 403 (domain key lacks access)
GET {{host}}/api/v1/info
X-API-Key: {{domainKey}}

### Invalidate auth cache (admin only)
POST {{host}}/api/v1/admin/auth/cache/invalidate
X-API-Key: {{adminKey}}
